    <body>
      <div>
        <head>Related Work</head>
        <p>Unlike prior rendering systems <ref type="bibr" target="#b0" coords="2,10,20,30,8">[1]</ref>, our approach preserves geometry.</p>
        <p>We build on Vision Transformers <ref type="bibr" target="#b1" coords="2,10,40,30,8">[2]</ref> for global context.</p>
        <p>We compare against the strong diffusion baseline <ref type="bibr" target="#b2" coords="3,10,20,30,8">[3]</ref>.</p>
      </div>
